  "description": {
    "text": "Champions League 2023 Niigata, added to the season after it began, was held at Toki Messe in Niigata on 6 and 7 May 2023, without spectators, with the master league alone on the first day. The top four of each league were invited to the 2023 World Championships. Its top finishers in each league won Victory Symbol in a print for their place, with the placing and the city in small text on the Champions League logo: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth."
  },
